msgid ""
"**Use appropriate zoom levels** — Match zoom to model requirements "
"(typically 17-18)"
msgstr "**使用适当的缩放级别** - 将缩放与模型要求相匹配（通常为 17-18）"

#: ../api/api_reference.rst:1399 b923daa540e84906b19f162381acf6b8
